from ui_incremental import *
record(P+'ViewModels/ControlCenterViewModel.Operations.cs','Business-day open/close/reopen, exception review and generic pending operation delegate.',[
('OnSelectedHistoryDayChanged','Starts selection load only when editable/not loading; SelectDay refuses other dialogs and snapshots selected ID, avoids switching current day during retained financial writes.'),
('CanOpenDay','Requires completed valid history load, permission and no existing active day across Days; CanClose shared base requires no server blockers. Server must re-evaluate atomically because client snapshot can age.'),
('OpenDayAction','Only opens action whose explicit gate true; resets reason/date. Open date invariant yyyy-MM-dd optional; reopening requires reason. No implicit DB operation merely opening form.'),
('SubmitDayActionAsync','Creates immutable typed requests with Guid for fresh open/close/reopen; if pending calls RunOperation rather than rebuilding. Close sends no approval here because CanClose requires real permission; server authoritative.'),
('SubmitExceptionAsync','Requires review permission and mandatory reason; known options acknowledged/resolved. Immutable request retained by delegate.'),
('SetOperation','Stores closed-over request in _pendingOperation delegate only, no journal. Power loss loses identity for day financial close/open/reopen/checklist/exception operations; parent can merge UI-001 extension.'),
('RunOperationAsync','Unknown history sticky across later definite reject, first definite rejection clears and reloads, success clears dialogs and reloads; finally pending session registration through IsBusy change. HasPendingOperation includes durable _safeDropRequest but this retry runner returns if delegate null, so generic RetryOperation cannot retry recovered safe drop itself; separate safe-drop submit does.')],
'ControlCenterWriteSafetyTests cover same-session fake HTTP, review separately. Missing day process recovery and recovered safe-drop generic retry reachability.',
'Persist typed day/exception operations, make retry dispatch handle each actual pending owner, use server blocker/permission truth.')
record(P+'ViewModels/ControlCenterViewModel.Reconciliation.cs','Real reconciliation/snapshot reads and durable safe-drop action.',[
('LoadReconciliationAsync','Requires reports_view; failed fetch sets null but no dedicated error, then ReconciliationDifference returns0 through null-coalesce. XAML may display0for unavailable data unless gated; inspect parent binding before claiming.'),
('OpenSafeDrop','Requires editable active day, resets inputs/PIN; HasOpenShiftForDrop reads shared session rather than querying at open. Submit guards actual ShiftId presence; server validates freshness.'),
('SubmitSafeDropAsync','Recovered request sent before current form checks, valid identity-preserving recovery. Fresh amount positive/reason/approval; uses actual current shift and actor.'),
('CompleteSafeDropAsync','Durable helper, rotate key on success, action amount from server, reload day. Constructor base actually restores dialog/request fields and session pending, better than several other management consumers.'),
('SnapshotReconciliation','Deserializes persisted JSON each property read without JsonException catch/version contract; malformed/older snapshot can throw during binding. Does not recompute historic snapshot intentionally.'),
('LoadSnapshotAsync','Sets latest snapshot null on failed query, no dedicated reason, unknown/no snapshot conflated. ResolveApproval helper is one real PIN approval endpoint, no local identity trust.')],
'Missing malformed snapshot JSON/native binding recovery and unavailable reconciliation rendering; no DB writes/restore tested.',
'Distinguish unavailable vs zero snapshot data and deserialize once with safe error handling; preserve working recovered safe-drop context.')
record(P+'ViewModels/ControlCenterViewModel.cs','Day state, close blockers/checklist/exception reads and embedded count.',[
('ControlCenterViewModel','Constructs CashCount; restores pending safe-drop fields/dialog and registers pending at construction, a concrete correct recovery pattern. Does not recover generic in-memory day operations.'),
('ReloadAsync','Loads day history then selected/current/dayfallback; legitimate404without history yields no day. Blockers/checklist/exceptions sequentially read and replaced. LoadError suppresses HasBusinessDay/close, so stale blockers cannot falsely enable close after query failure.'),
('CanClose','Requires active loaded day, permission and zero blocker snapshot; server still responsible final atomic checks. Read-only status explanatory, not bypass.'),
('ToggleChecklistItemAsync','Captures intended !item.Completed once, stores generic operation before send; safely retries exact intended boolean within process, but no disk persistence.'),
('OpenCashCountAsync','Opens embedded count for actual selected day; CashCount own permission. No dummy records invented.')],
'Missing cross-process day-operation recovery, snapshots errors and partial sequential read UI test; parent source checklist comparison ongoing.',
'Use durable generic request record and actual recovery dialog; preserve error states distinct from no day and server-final close verdict.')
record(P+'ViewModels/CashCountViewModel.cs','Business-day denomination count form/history with durable save.',[
('DenominationRow','Quantity uses long.TryParse without Arabic/Persian normalization; invalid/negative input silently treated0. At least one valid row allows bad other row to submit0instead of flagging; source data-entry risk distinct from backend totals authority. Product multiplication unchecked long can overflow in live display/Rows.Sum.'),
('OpenAsync','Requires cash_count and no global unresolved op, sets businessDay and opens then loads. Recovered _write exists but no constructor form reopening/target; on load IsLoading triggers session pending, can block later open paths. Save supports recovered DTO independent day but native retry reachability must be verified.'),
('LoadAsync','Fetches server denominations and actual history; detaches prior row Changed events before replacement, attaches new once, correct event hygiene. IsReady only true after both reads; no hardcoded denomination list.'),
('SaveAsync','Fresh requires CanAct/date/user, any positive quantity and valid expected amount; captures all row quantities and ShiftId with stable pendingId, uses durable helper. Does not reject every malformed row individually. Success display uses server authoritative counted/difference and reloads.'),
('NotifyState','Session gate busy or retained pending, triggered by busy/loading changes not constructor. Close blocks pending. Difference negation long.Min overflow theoretical if server domain accepts extreme values, not normal restaurant scenario.')],
'Need invalid/Arabic count row error tests, process recovery target/retry UI, numeric limits and zero physical count policy. No counts written.',
'Normalize/validate every row explicitly and use checked bounded arithmetic; bind recovered business-day target and visible retry.')
record(P+'ViewModels/ShiftsViewModel.Open.cs','Management-page shift open dialog and actual open command.',[
('OpenOpenShiftModalAsync','Loads real settings suggestion and optional main balance; caps suggested float to actual visible balance. No busy state during prefetch; double open or navigation can leave late modal on detached view, no money moved yet.'),
('CloseOpenShiftModal','Unconditional close even while IsOpeningShift; no unresolved write guard. Main page/session does not register pending busy, shell can leave/lock while open request in flight.'),
('ConfirmOpenShiftAsync','Positive/nonnegative money validation, own busy guard, creates new Guid RequestId every invocation. On transport ambiguity displays error but no frozen DTO/key retained. Retry can use edited amount/new key, unlike primary cashier flow UI-001. Exact server single-active-shift constraint can reject duplicate open but cannot reconstruct original result from changed identity.'),
('MainTreasuryIsEmpty','Correct permission gate for balance display; domain insufficient-balance string masked for users without treasury visibility. Fragile localization substring match is not security boundary, server error output also matters.')],
'No concrete reconstructed or same-session unknown-result management open test observed yet; parent financial peer notified UI-016.',
'Use same durable immutable operation coordination as primary cashier; prevent close/navigation/user switch through unknown financial outcome; retain exact key.')
record(P+'ViewModels/ShiftsViewModel.Close.cs','Management two-step blind close; separate presentation of existing handler.',[
('OpenCloseShiftModal','Checks CanCloseShift and active shift; clears preview/count/reason/PIN. Does not check other management write busy/pending because no shared gate defined here.'),
('PrepareCloseShiftAsync','Valid nonnegative count and active shift, server expected preview. Busy guard only IsClosingShift; BackToCloseShiftCount unconditionally clears preview while async confirmation can run, property changes can disrupt live method reads.'),
('ConfirmCloseShiftAsync','Manager discrepancy reason+approval validated; creates fresh Guid every submit and no immutable retained DTO/outcomeUnknown history. ActiveShift and preview reread after awaited approval could be changed by reload/other UI; server validates but wrong target/context risk. Normal cancellation closes if !busy only, then new attempt uses new identity.'),
('CancelCloseShiftModal','Busy blocks cancel while request active, but after unknown failure busy false allows discard; no global session pending registration. Success clears shared shift and reloads authoritative history.')],
'No actual shift write run; need fake HTTP commit/lost-response retry identity tests and UI lock/navigation assertions. Same domain handler does not mean same client safety as cashier.',
'Freeze close request once, durable owner state, global pending gate and immutable target/preview snapshot across approval await.')
record(P+'ViewModels/ShiftsViewModel.cs','Management active shift/history/details and document reprint.',[
('LoadAsync','No IsLoading entry guard/cancellation/version; overlapping loads may overwrite current shift/session with stale result. Treats ANY current shift failure as null, clears shared ShiftId/Name silently even network error; can make cashier UI wrongly think no shift despite server open.'),
('ReprintAsync','Fresh Guid every press; correct typed slip document and real actor, says queued not paper confirmed. Unknown result not retained and no global pending gate, retry can enqueue extra slip. No actual printers invoked.'),
('FormatCairo','Correct explicit Cairo conversion for timestamps unlike Header clock local timezone.'),
('ShiftRow','Maps real summary fields, status Closed exact case. CashDifference null becomes0then IsBalanced true for closed record lacking counted difference; potential misleading balanced unknown state, contract null semantics require server DTO proof.'),
('CanOpenShift','Uses actual shifts_manage/own; history reports_view, main balance treasury_manage. No OnIsOpeningShiftChanged/OnIsClosingShiftChanged session gate anywhere three partials: same-session safety gap source-confirmed UI-016.')],
'Native management layout probe and backend financial tests separate; need failed current shift fetch keeps/labels unknown, overlapping-load ordering, ambiguous reprint identity.',
'Share reliable shift/session refresh error contract and operation coordinator; do not convert missing numeric history to matched count without evidence.')
record(P+'ViewModels/SettingsViewModel.cs','Partial restaurant settings load/save and local appearance initialization.',[
('SettingsViewModel','Initializes local appearance partial immediately; undefined persisted AppTheme can cause First exception in companion, already noted ThemeService. _loaded gates save.'),
('LoadAsync','Reads actual settings, fills all visible fields and print flags; preserves properties not in update DTO as null. No guard against IsSaving, so concurrent refresh can replace form while save in progress; actual XAML button disable state to inspect.'),
('SaveAsync','Parses money with CashInput, integers nonnegative AutoLock and copies>=1. Does not check CanEdit internally though UI permission intended; backend must enforce. Builds partial request with current form, UpdateSettings response set_loaded and header actual identity. No retained unknown outcome/global busy gate: retry/new user can rebuild request; configuration idempotent value replacement semantics differ from duplicate money.'),
('AutoLockMinutesText','Exposes persisted auto-lock setting, but neither root/MainViewModel reviewed implemented idle monitor; parent checking repository-wide use. Saving setting not proof feature operational.'),
('HoldPreparationUntilPaymentConfirmed','Exposes real kitchen hold setting, warns different from owner desired unpaid pickup preparation stage. Changing could affect actual printed work; audit did not invoke save.')],
'Settings appearance excluded headless tests. Need per-field partial-null roundtrip, unauthorized save, invalid integer Arabic counts and ambiguous update UI tests; no settings changes made.',
'Clearly distinguish local theme vs server config save; validate actual auto-lock implementation and preserve safe concurrency/authoritative permission.')
